00:07:16.552 --> 00:07:20.584
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:21.184 --> 00:07:27.975
<v Slow>ズーラシアに来た人は、全部で何人になりましたか。

00:07:28.776 --> 00:07:33.456
<v Host>Thirty million people — about a quarter of Japan's population.

00:07:34.055 --> 00:07:40.103
<v Slow>ズーラシアで一番有名な動物は何ですか。

00:07:40.903 --> 00:07:45.175
<v Host>The okapi — a rare relative of the giraffe with striped legs.

00:07:45.776 --> 00:07:51.463
<v Slow>ズーラシアは、何年に開園しましたか。

00:07:52.264 --> 00:07:56.079
<v Host>In nineteen ninety-nine — about twenty-seven years ago.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:08:04.480
<v Host>That's all for today. Congratulations, Zoorasia — here's to the next thirty million visitors. See you next time.

00:08:05.079 --> 00:08:07.480
<v News>また明日。
